# Freminet Furian Yelan Escoffier. ~24s Rot. Phys Shatter-Freminet with Escoffier. Freminet insets an NA between skills not on CD for higher Yelan damage, Causing his burst to expire before the fourth shattering pressure. Vs Freezable opponents, EM Sands Freminet is 1% behind ATK Sands with ATK% weapons.

